d? Seems a bit too much (on top of creating a fairly large diff). Could the rest of the…"],["bf5071d1_3870e228",38,-4,1,"This is a very generic name which is fragile when relying on this bubbling to parent elements which migth already have another 'close' handler for some other child element. Consider making those…"],["05b9c8e6_a109c0e5",40,-1,1,"Should this go here instead? https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:chrome/browser/ui/webui/searchbox/searchbox_handler.cc;drc=cb8f6bdfc89aa5c1e166b0dd7ee837e15f4d0e99;l=328"],["62785edc_aa44aff8",41,-1,1,"I don't think the carousel should have a concept of who the embedder is. What would happen today of we just always sent open-voice-search? Would both the realbox and composebox try to catch it and…"],["78d6882c_87f78d66",24,-1,1,"This should be done in a way that is cleaned up when the test finishes. Is it cleaned up anywhere currently or is this leaking into other tests? I suspect the latter."],["8e8495c2_baf0beb5",23,-1,1,"CustomEvent should be accomodated by the type of the payload's event. ```suggestion protected onVoiceSearchSubmit_(e: CustomEvent<TypeGoesHere>) { ```"],["923c1df9_3aa99025",38,-1,1,"Is the wrapper object necessary? How about the following instead? ```suggestion this.fire('voice-search-submit', this.transcript_); ```"],["a67ec5c6_cb74fe5b",24,-1,1,"Is this necessary in addition to line 91? Seems a bit odd."],["b5fd429c_6f771aaf",24,-1,0,"Are you sure that this is correct. Isn't SpeechRecognitionEvent supposed to inherit from `Event` per https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/SpeechRecognitionEvent ? Using `as uknown as ...`…"],["b75dc491_09496d04",38,-1,1,"Should this be called on disconnectedCallback() as well? What happens if theu element is disconnected while voice recognition has started?"],["bf5dcde1_1e42ea4a",38,-1,1,"Unnecesasry override?"],["e0382949_ca6ef01f",42,-1,1,"Need to import the file that defines this. See bot failures."],["e446bde8_a47b7425",38,-1,1,"Is the voice search component closed by the time this event is fired? If not, please name events after what happened, not after what will happen later. ```suggestion…"],["ea0dd5b0_f7f71cbc",24,-1,1,"composebox_test.ts is already a huge file. Are you sure that these tests are not better placed in a new more targeted test file? A 2000+ LOC test file is an anti pattern and we shouldn't perpetually…"]],0,341],[7131502,20399,24,0.683,0.532,[[19,0.393,17,10],[7,0.393,143,10],[20,0.214,14,4]],[],0,342],[7132181,20402,291,5.1,4.1,[[4,0.622,101,178],[2,0.355,63,104],[7,0.017,144,4],[3,0.007,85,1]],[["a06019b1_6a938c00",39,-3,1,"Nit: I'd think this needs four more indents"]],0,343],[7138688,20403,135,4.183,3.38,[[4,0.545,102,76],[2,0.4,64,57],[7,0.055,145,4]],[["e65e39ac_b929fd8e",38,0,0,"Nit: maybe just inline"],["f5e179e6_dcc2c5bd",43,0,1,"Do you have a screenshot for this UI? What does it look like in dark mode and themed NTPs?"]],0,344],[7142227,20405,26,0.721,0.543,[[25,0.828,10,23],[5,0.172,63,3]],[],0,345],[7148207,20405,2,0.164,0.137,[[4,103]],[],0,346],[7153218,20406,73,2.344,1.853,[[7,0.992,146,1381],[11,0.004,8,4],[26,0.003,15,3],[24,0.001,1,1]],[],0,347],[7158027,20406,74,2.344,1.853,[[7,0.993,147,1454],[26,0.003,16,3],[11,0.003,9,4],[24,0.001,2,1]],[["51a5a8a8_097e4087",8,0,0,"FYI, for the future, Lei taught me its better to go to the original CL that got reverted and \"Create reland\" rather than reverting a revert."]],0,348],[7157657,20407,10,0.562,0.384,[[4,104]],[],0,348],[7147009,20407,249,4.195,3.394,[[7,0.646,147,166],[5,0.299,64,70],[17,0.055,7,13]],[],0,349],[7157621,20409,72,2.344,1.853,[[7,0.993,148,1452],[26,0.003,16,3],[11,0.003,9,4],[24,0.001,2,1]],[["ac00569a_70482dfe",44,0,1,"Why is this change being made? It un-alphabetizes the list of dependencies."]],0,350],[7161540,20409,249,4.195,3.394,[[7,0.646,148,166],[5,0.299,65,70],[17,0.055,8,13]],[],0,350],[7163955,20410,1,0.142,0.088,[[7,149]],[],0,351],[7204681,20418,65,2.344,1.853,[[7,0.781,150,52],[27,0